CLI. Something like:

./pricer --type call --exercise european --S 100 --K 100 --r 0.05 --q 0 --sigma 0.2 --T 1 --method bs
./pricer --method binomial --steps 500
./pricer --method mc --paths 100000 --seed 42
Print price; for MC also print stderr. For BS also print Greeks.

